   "titulo": "Purpose of a displacement",
   "texto": [
    "**-(으)러 가다/오다** indica qué acción motiva el desplazamiento: 먹다 → **먹으러 가요** (voy a comer), 사다 → **사러 가요** (voy a comprar), 보다 → **보러 가요** (voy a ver). It is usually used with verbs of movement; the purpose is expressed with this form before the retro / rec."
   ]
